@startuml SD05_Accounting_ConfirmPayment
hide footbox
title SD05 Accounting Confirms Payment

actor AcctUser as AccountingUser
participant App as ShopRentalApplication
participant Accounting
participant Payment

AcctUser -> App: choose Confirm active payment
App -> App: getActivePayment()
App -> Accounting: confirmPaymentTransfer(payment)
Accounting -> Payment: verifyPayment()
Payment --> Accounting: true/false (status updated if true)
Accounting --> App: confirmed
App -> App: saveStateQuietly()
App --> AcctUser: Payment confirmed result
@enduml